  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "The claws' heights, lean and spacing, the pool shape, the smoke and the crackle change per cast. The grab always lands at 600 ms."
  },
  "director_notes": "Warlock line, dark shadow magic. Shadow can't glow additively, so the dark parts are alpha (the pool, the smoke) or lit meshes in a dark colour (the claws: eruption spikes with negative tilt so they lean in like closing fingers), and violet additive layers (the rim glyphs, the chain, the crackle) carry the magic. The chain is an energy beam with two spiral strands."
